  "bio": "Good Trip Inc, based in Raleigh, United States, is an esteemed tattoo studio renowned for its exceptional Realism tattoo artworks. Catering to clients 18 and older, they specialize in monochromatic creations with strict adherence to original designs, providing an immersive artistic journey without offering cover-ups or color. Please use email for queries or booking appointments.\n\nOwner of @goodtripgallery",
